      "details": [
        {
          "text": "Developed the frontend with Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS, Sass, animated Lottie visuals, sticky project cards, responsive sections, and optimized image-driven project previews."
        },
        {
          "text": "Built backend API routes for contact form handling, input validation, email template generation, SMTP delivery with Nodemailer, and environment-based configuration."
        },
        {
          "text": "Integrated Google reCAPTCHA verification support and client-side validation to reduce invalid submissions before they reach the email workflow."
        },
        {
          "text": "Organized profile, skills, education, experience, company logos, CV assets, and project data into reusable data modules for easier updates."
        },
        {
          "text": "Configured the app for local development and deployment with Next.js metadata, Docker files, environment variables, and static assets served through the public folder."
        }
